<title>NETHERLANDS: Reuters 2nd ex-Amsterdam Americas/Africa air cargo.</title>
<headline>Reuters 2nd ex-Amsterdam Americas/Africa air cargo.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>This is Reuters' 22nd ex-Amsterdan air cargo market report. It will be published regularly until a new version is published at a later date.</p>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Amsterdam Dutch guilder air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>				     May 7	vs	  Feb 28</p>
<p>				    UNITED STATES</p>
<p>AMS-JFK			    1.80			1.60</p>
<p>AMS-LAX			    2.45			2.35</p>
<p>AMS-CHI			    1.80			1.80</p>
<p>AMS-MIA			    2.20			2.20</p>
<p>				    LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>AMS-MEX			    3.30			3.70</p>
<p>AMS-BOG			    3.90			3.75</p>
<p>AMS-SCL(CHILE)		   5.35			5.35</p>
<p>AMS-SAO			    5.25			5.35</p>
<p>				     AFRICA</p>
<p> AMS-JNB			   3.90			4.25</p>
<p> AMS-NBO			   2.30			2.35</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Amsterdan Schiphol airport. *All prices are quoted in Dutch guilders.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
